## SELF-VALIDATION CHECKLIST

- [ ] Only canonical event types used (never abbreviated)
- [ ] `trackEvent()` wrapped in try/catch — never crashes quiz flow
- [ ] `quiz_started` emitted when first question renders (storefront)
- [ ] `quiz_completed` emitted with result page data on submission
- [ ] `question_answered` emitted per question (storefront, fire-and-forget)
