- [ ] Storefront widget wraps in try/catch + unhandledrejection listener

---

## NEVER

- Never show a blank white page on errors (Law 9)
- Never expose raw stack traces to users in production
- Never use `window.alert()` for errors (use Banner + ErrorBoundary)
- Never forget to re-throw `Response` errors from loaders (auth redirects)
- Never create error boundaries without navigation out (always provide a CTA)
- Never let widget errors break the merchant's storefront page

